":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VdST"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dd187bf-5229-4fbc-85bc-66fc22448ae5","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分に嘘をつくのはやめよう。s/あんま好きじゃない/嫌い/g","ts":"1630659679.108600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":5,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL","U7TMPGWJ0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6R9b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc501b99-f86c-4d4a-8fb9-32d6a402e411","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ショートハンドでactionの詳細な型を書かなくていいみたいなやつを導入してるせいでAction名が全部潰されてデバッガに渡ってくるんですよ","ts":"1630659663.107900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ECC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f68b8895-5b39-4acc-989f-847f6825134f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"w","ts":"1630659656.107600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"add"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15c18c9c-9845-4cae-b4e3-6b14f202fbe4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Redux あんま好きじゃないので詳しくないｗ","ts":"1630659647.107200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gc7qg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d3047f9-bc3f-4690-8ffc-ef400f643caf","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"巨大な global state 辛い問題よくわかる","ts":"1630659554.105900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v5gL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0bcda51-fae7-470e-87e0-4f5534eb24d4","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そのグローバルステート管理してくれる君が redux みたいに判定してくれるのであれば、行けそうですね。","ts":"1630659520.105400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8n6yz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f15415d2-4c28-436a-a13f-36d10ce708fa","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"雑にGlobal State側にinitialized生やせば解決するのかなぁこれ","ts":"1630659478.104800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=TO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c2dbaa3-ae85-4fcf-a885-e5d7cca0ba01","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"劣化reduxみたいなのを使っててめっちゃデバッグしにくいんですよね（素直にReduxだったら大分楽だったはず・・・）","ts":"1630659437.104300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ClS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a37df31-b287-4af8-8154-bac7307bc159","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どこ触っても大体大量のレンダリングが走るんですけど、再マウントも考慮しないとなのか","ts":"1630659389.103600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XJAp2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75fb04be-0b86-4336-ada7-6bca1400f4ac","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"既存のGlobal Stateがめちゃくちゃに大きくて辛い","ts":"1630659357.102800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m8gQE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dc5500b-1cc8-4d92-a258-06722be1f0cf","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"redux に突っ込んで判定するのが一番楽？","ts":"1630659349.102400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v1S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7954da9c-60e8-4880-90d9-01b7cec8aed2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、再マウント自体を防がないとなのか・・・","ts":"1630659340.102100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m5u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2fd8834-f976-42b3-b63f-68d6c7d150f7","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"再レンダリング !== 再マウント　です。","ts":"1630659328.101700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gas"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91d039dc-f614-4092-b108-1dbdb29b0d55","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"それはコンポーネントローカルなステートなので、再マウントされたらもう一度 fetch が走りますね。","ts":"1630659306.101400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kyfem"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbd3dc43-ac46-40e7-9f75-cb19ed893759","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"データの有無で判定できるのかなこれ・・・","ts":"1630659230.100700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EOfOM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3d5d0f5-c2fb-4bec-8f38-c30d48c6d391","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"大体こんな感じ\n```const [initialized, setInitialized] = useState(false);\n\nuseEffect(() =\u0026gt; {\n  const f = async () =\u0026gt; {\n    if (!initialized) {\n      await initialize(id);\n      setInitialized(true);\n    }\n  };\n  f();\n}, []);```","ts":"1630659216.100400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I8QO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8703eb82-5e7a-4bdc-9ca5-de8fe33ffef4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"であれば、ステート側にデータがすでにあれば fetch しないってコードにするだけな気はします。","ts":"1630659136.100200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l2GF="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c805677b-b618-483d-880e-a95e6e72fa55","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"です、クソでかいJSONまとめて取ってきてStateに突っ込んでるんですよね","ts":"1630659066.099800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gz6lB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3dd171cf-05a3-4be6-983c-4b82ae6365b2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"一回しか実行しないというのは、コンポーネントが再マウントしても再取得したくないみたいな話ですかね？","ts":"1630659024.099100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q9Zf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6281eede-963a-49c7-a4e7-2e0bc386d9f6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"既存がfetchしてきた結果でglobal stateを初期化するinitializeみたいな関数生やしてて、それを1回しか実行させないようにするためにuseEffect内でフラグ切り替えて管理したかったんですけど、その手の処理でなんかいいやり方ってあります？","ts":"1630658979.098200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FsvrJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2177d95-67ce-45f7-9220-39adc7b9e551","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"もちろん、ref の値からステートが定まるようなケースの場合は useEffect -\u0026gt; setState しないと無理ではあります。","ts":"1630658961.097700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wfI3f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"843a1498-23e7-44c3-af85-84cef7df2f7e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、なるほど","ts":"1630658878.096100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=TLe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05a7c518-619c-4ce2-a8b5-600f494200d8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あと、useEffect で setState するのはできれば避けたほうがいいやつですね。（dispatch してグローバルステートが変わる系は流石に必要ですが、あ、このケースでも無限ループしうるな）","ts":"1630658804.095900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9K7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60613791-ced2-4ed4-ab97-ae414d6a684c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"useEffect の deps がどっかおかしいのかなと推察します。","ts":"1630658764.095000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"09YJk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a6e142f-377e-4e77-9aea-ecf846701f45","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"useEffect の中で setState してるケースで、setState によってまた useEffect が発生するような場合に出るエラーですね。","ts":"1630658736.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pjk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c9f99e5-8c18-43c1-92f7-2b871933886f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"既存のくそでかいコンポーネントを使い回す必要があって\n```Too many re-renders. React limits the number of renders to prevent an infinite loop.```\nが起きて死んでるんですけど、これって効率よくpropsのdiffを確認する方法ってありますっけ","ts":"1630657935.093400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gJJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55471af4-75a9-48fa-a13c-1462b7a4a917","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"エディタで編集してて大半気付くしCIで担保したらいいんですよ","ts":"1630643406.089800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UBNPMJJGM","UMQ5RBYSH"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W1q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dce45d21-55f9-4914-b3aa-5bdf6f05718e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"transpile onlyじゃないとwebpackとかで遅すぎて死ぬ","ts":"1630643382.089400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MjE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b077e41-684b-4c12-88ca-d5c17a9e7b1b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そうですね","ts":"1630643366.089000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vBfO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dbd7827-ff01-4261-af39-4e466de392ba","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ycino さんとかトランスパイルオンリーで型チェックは watch で別で回してた覚え。","ts":"1630637651.088700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oxn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"104f21ea-e3e5-4ef8-9c3d-2f583222e552","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"型チェックをちゃんと別口で担保できるというのであればよさそう","ts":"1630637585.087700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8bhh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2f0e94d-a558-4214-9e84-a2dd17ed00e0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"jest 自体は本当に遅いので単純に高速化したいというのならアリですね。","ts":"1630637545.087300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vox3X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b14667ea-04e1-4d0d-8f48-1c6963adbdc3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"jestはそう表現してるんですね\nまあ普通に表記揺れの範疇なので一瞬「ん？」と思っただけですけど","ts":"1630637330.086800"